      "explanation": "Apgar: A=Appearance (color), P=Pulse (HR), G=Grimace (reflex irritability), A=Activity (tone), R=Respiration. Scored 0-2 each at 1 and 5 minutes. 7-10=normal, 4-6=moderate depression, <4=severe."
